eb/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:e6ba025426ad6f1176ed28bb4874699a793cb9d706818faec2829a8f301b967f","file":"preprints/Log-abundance-in-numerical-dimension-one-for-threefolds-in-positive-characteristic-October-5-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":15,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"f32b343e40f0f4534cbbc612645b2a6d6bb8244edb10c1c608fc541e612e7ff3","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Log-abundance-in-numerical-dimension-one-for-threefolds-in-positive-characteristic-October-5-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:e6ba025426ad6f1176ed28bb4874699a793cb9d706818faec2829a8f301b967f","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Log-abundance-in-numerical-dimension-one-for-threefolds-in-positive-characteristic-October-5-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L15"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nLet $k$ be an algebraically closed field of characteristic $p>3$.\nLet $(X,B)$ be a projective log canonical threefold pair over $k$,\nwhere $X$ is normal, $B$ is an effective $\\Q$-divisor, and $K_X+B$\nis $\\Q$-Cartier. If $K_X+B$ is nef and has numerical dimension one,\nthen $K_X+B$ is semiample."}
